.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

enterprise_env

commands.md

# Working notes — kept local, not part of the published repo.
# Anchored to the repo root so a docs/DECISIONS.md later isn't caught by these.
/DECISIONS.md
/FAILURES.md
/IDEAS.md
/QUESTIONS.md
/PLAN_MULTISITE.md

